* ib_conv_v1_pex -- flat R+C PEX wrapped as a subckt.
* External terminals are the bare port-label nodes (rule: exact port-label name):
*   IBIAS INP INM OUT VDD VSS. All VDD.tN / VSS.tN / VSS.nNNN stay INTERNAL and are
*   NOT tied together -- tying them would short out the extracted bus resistance.
* Generated with ext2spice scale off, so dimensions are absolute and mix with the
*   absolute-unit DIV2 bench. The committed .pex.spice carries .option scale=5n and
*   is NOT mixable.
.subckt ib_conv_v1_pex_nor IBIAS INP INM OUT VDD VSS
X0 a_938_3424.t1 INP a_100_n800.t0 VSS nfet_03v3 ad=3.52p pd=16.88u as=3.52p ps=16.88u w=8u l=0.3u
X1 a_938_3424.t1 a_938_3424.t1 VDD VDD pfet_03v3 ad=3.52p pd=16.88u as=3.52p ps=16.88u w=8u l=0.3u
X2 a_8030_n1600.t1 a_6430_n1100.t1 VDD VDD pfet_03v3 ad=19.36p pd=88.88u as=19.36p ps=88.88u w=44u l=0.3u
