X4 a_6430_n1100.t1 a_2156_7176.t2 VDD VDD pfet_03v3 ad=11.44p pd=52.88u as=11.44p ps=52.88u w=26u l=0.3u
X5 a_2430_n800.t0 INM a_100_n800.t0 VSS nfet_03v3 ad=3.52p pd=16.88u as=3.52p ps=16.88u w=8u l=0.3u
X6 a_6430_n1100.t1 a_2156_7176.t2 VSS VSS nfet_03v3 ad=4.84p pd=22.88u as=4.84p ps=22.88u w=11u l=0.3u
X7 OUT a_8030_n1600.t1 VSS ppolyf_u_1k r_width=2u r_length=2u
